   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sunny glamour: bright median (~144), deep blacks (~10), warm brown shadows (39,25,20), red-dominant palette (55%), golden-tan glowing skin (187,144,116), clean warm highlights. Best for: Cover-style bride and groom portraits in sun or big soft light, pre-wedding shoots in beach/resort light, red and gold outfits, confident full-body fashion poses. Needs well-lit frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
